    1981       NA          NA     NA     NA
    1982   0.6962     0.16578 0.3303 0.9142
    1983   0.9231     0.07288 0.6161 0.9890
    1984   0.9130     0.05818 0.7140 0.9779
    1985   0.9008     0.05384 0.7360 0.9673
    1986   0.9324     0.04581 0.7685 0.9829
    1987   1.0000     0.00000 1.0000 1.0000

