    1981   0.7182     0.15555 0.3610 0.9200
    1982   0.4347     0.06883 0.3075 0.5711
    1983   0.4782     0.05971 0.3644 0.5943
    1984   0.6261     0.05927 0.5048 0.7334
    1985   0.5985     0.05605 0.4855 0.7019
    1986   0.5306     0.05041 0.4319 0.6270
    1987       NA          NA     NA     NA

The fixedbeta vector has NA for each beta parameter except the one(s) you want to fix. It's mentioned lower down the help page for ipsecr.fit.

Murray

